+/**
+ * Extra voices (a host's own, past the PS1's 24): voices 24..47, with registers
+ * of their own laid out as the SPU's first 0x200 bytes (Psyz_SpuWriteExt): the
+ * voice registers at 0x000 (voice 24 first), key on 0x188/0x18A, key off
